<title>NEW ZEALAND: Tyndall Australia unit buys BZW fund in NZ.</title>
<headline>Tyndall Australia unit buys BZW fund in NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyndall Australia Ltd said on Wednesday its wholly owned subsidiary, The New Zealand Guardian Trust Company Ltd, had agreeed to buy the New Zealand based investment management business of BZW Investment Management.</p>
<p>The price was for a maximum of A$800,000 and is conditional upon the number of clients agreeing to transfer to Guardian Trust.</p>
<p>The acquisition of this business would increase Guardian Trust's Funds under management by approx NZ$144 million and represents a significant diversification of the funds management activities in NZ, it said.  </p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
